Dokumen BRD ini mencakup kebutuhan bisnis tingkat tinggi untuk seluruh modul ERP, meliputi:

* Organization Management
* User & Access Management
* Master Data Management
* Procurement
* Purchasing
* Inventory Management
* Warehouse Management
* Sales Management
* Customer Relationship Management (CRM)
* Human Resource Management (HRM)
* Payroll
* Finance & Accounting
* Fixed Asset Management
* Manufacturing
* Project Management
* Document Management
* Reporting & Dashboard
* Workflow Management
* Notification Management
* Integration
* Audit Trail

Dokumen ini tidak membahas detail implementasi teknis seperti desain basis data, spesifikasi API, maupun rancangan antarmuka pengguna.

